147
00:10:32.174 --> 00:10:35.385
Tutupi adegan kedatangannya
dan dapatkan wawancara, Wi Jeong-sin.

148
00:10:37.179 --> 00:10:38.096
Aku?

149
00:10:39.473 --> 00:10:41.224
Anda meliput K-pop.

150
